# Yasharn, Implacable Earth's enters trigger: "search your library for a basic Forest card and a basic Plains card, reveal
# those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle" (CR 701.23, 701.20a). Bot1's library holds two basic Forests, a basic
# Plains, a Breeding Pool (a Forest, but not basic) and Islands. The search refuses the Breeding Pool, an Island, and two
# Forests at once (one of each, never two of one); it takes a Forest and the Plains, which are revealed and reach the hand,
# while the other Forest and the Breeding Pool stay in the library, which is shuffled (its Islands no longer on top).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Yasharn, Implacable Earth
Island x4
Forest
Breeding Pool
Forest
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yasharn, Implacable Earth.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Search(Breeding Pool)
! Bot1.Search(Island)
! Bot1.Search(Forest; Forest)
Bot1.Search(Forest; Plains)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Island; Island; Island; Island; Plains
Bot1.Revealed = Forest; Plains
Bot1.Library = Island; Forest; Island; Island; Island; Breeding Pool; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
